2. THE NONCOMMERCIAL TERM IS INHERITED, NOT CHOSEN
--------------------------------------------------

The compiled engine embeds a Vietnamese syllable dictionary derived from the
Leipzig Corpora Collection corpus `vie_news_2020_1M`, which is distributed under
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial (CC BY-NC).

Commercial rights in that data are therefore not the copyright holder's to
grant, and cannot be granted by any license placed on this directory. This is
why the noncommercial term cannot be waived on request.

If you are forking NexusKey and intend any commercial use, you must build with
`-DVKEY_USE_RUST_ENGINE=OFF` and not redistribute these files. NexusKey is
fully functional on its in-tree C++ engine without them.


3. REQUIRED ATTRIBUTION FOR THE EMBEDDED DATA
---------------------------------------------

If you redistribute the compiled engine, these notices must travel with it.

Vietnamese syllable dictionary and news frequencies
  Leipzig Corpora Collection, corpus `vie_news_2020_1M`. License: CC BY-NC.
  Required citation: Dirk Goldhahn, Thomas Eckart, and Uwe Quasthoff. 2012.
  Building Large Monolingual Dictionaries at the Leipzig Corpora Collection:
  From 100 to 200 Languages. In Proceedings of the Eighth International
  Conference on Language Resources and Evaluation (LREC'12), pages 759-765,
  Istanbul, Turkey. ELRA. https://aclanthology.org/L12-1154/

Spoken-register frequency evidence (frequencies only, never vocabulary)
  hermitdave/FrequencyWords, from OpenSubtitles2018 via OPUS.
  License: MIT, Copyright (c) 2016 Hermit Dave.
  Corpus citation: Pierre Lison and Jorg Tiedemann. 2016. OpenSubtitles2016:
  Extracting Large Parallel Corpora from Movie and TV Subtitles. LREC'16.

English word-membership list
  SCOWL (Spell Checking Oriented Word Lists) size tier 70, Kevin Atkinson.
  Collective work Copyright 2000-2011 by Kevin Atkinson; its permission notice
  requires this copyright notice to appear in all copies. Components reachable
  at size 70 requiring attribution: WordNet 1.6 Copyright 1997 by Princeton
  University, all rights reserved; VARCON / Ispell word lists Copyright 1993
  Geoff Kuenning, Granada Hills, CA, all rights reserved. Binary
  redistributions must reproduce those notices and their disclaimers in the
  documentation or other materials provided with the distribution.


